{"id": "referral-rehab-en-002", "language": "en", "doc_type": "referral", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Referral for outpatient rehabilitation (made-up example)", "original": "Referral for Outpatient Rehabilitation Services. Patient: James Whitfield. Referring provider: Dr. Priya Nair, Internal Medicine. The patient is referred for outpatient physical therapy (PT) and occupational therapy (OT) following a left middle cerebral artery stroke with residual right-sided weakness. Services will be provided at Lakeside Therapy Partners, 1180 Hillcrest Road, Durham, NC. Therapy is anticipated 2 times per week for 8 weeks. The clinic will contact the patient within 3 business days to schedule. If you have not been contacted, please call (919) 555-0121. Wear comfortable clothing and closed-toe shoes to each session.", "target": {"title": "Therapy after your stroke", "language": "en", "source": "Referral for outpatient rehabilitation (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "Therapy after your stroke", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "For: **James Whitfield**", "picture": "person"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "You had a **stroke**.", "picture": "brain"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Your **right side** is **weak**.", "picture": "weak arm"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Therapy** can help you **move** better.", "picture": "physical therapy"}]}, {"topic": "Two kinds of therapy", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Dr. Priya Nair** wants you to go.", "picture": "doctor"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Physical therapy** (PT).", "picture": "physical therapy"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Occupational therapy** (OT).", "picture": "occupational therapy"}]}, {"topic": "Where", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Lakeside Therapy Partners**", "picture": "clinic"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**1180 Hillcrest Road, Durham, NC**", "picture": "map"}]}, {"topic": "How often", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**2 times** a week.", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "For **8 weeks**.", "picture": "calendar"}]}, {"topic": "What to wear", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Wear **comfortable** clothes.", "picture": "clothes"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Wear **closed-toe shoes**.", "picture": "shoes"}]}, {"topic": "Making your visit", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "The clinic will **call you**.", "picture": "phone"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "They call within **3 business days**.", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "No call? **Call them**.", "picture": "phone"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Phone: (919) 555-0121", "picture": "phone"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": ["'Left middle cerebral artery stroke' simplified to 'stroke'. PT/OT kept by name without extra explanation; the SLP may want to add one simple line about each."]}}
{"id": "referral-swallow-study-es-001", "language": "es", "doc_type": "referral", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Orden de estudio de deglución (ejemplo inventado)", "original": "Orden de estudio. Paciente: Rosa Delgado. Se ha ordenado un estudio videofluoroscópico de la deglución (VFSS) para evaluar disfagia orofaríngea. Este estudio usa rayos X para ver cómo traga. El estudio se realizará en el Departamento de Radiología del Hospital Comunitario San Marcos, 2500 Avenida Central, primer piso. Su cita es el martes 9 de febrero de 2027 a las 9:30 a.m. Llegue 30 minutos antes para registrarse. No es necesario estar en ayunas. Traiga su lista de medicamentos y sus dentaduras, si las usa. Para preguntas, llame a Terapia del Habla al (919) 555-0146.", "target": {"title": "Un estudio para tragar", "language": "es", "source": "Orden de estudio de deglución (ejemplo inventado)", "pages": [{"topic": "Un estudio para tragar", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Para: **Rosa Delgado**", "picture": "persona"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Usted tiene **problemas** para **tragar**.", "picture": "tragar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Le van a hacer un **estudio**.", "picture": "examen"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Usa **rayos X** para ver cómo traga.", "picture": "rayos x"}]}, {"topic": "Cuándo", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**martes 9 de febrero de 2027**", "picture": "calendario"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**9:30 a.m.**", "picture": "reloj"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Llegue **30 minutos antes**.", "picture": "reloj"}]}, {"topic": "Dónde", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Hospital Comunitario San Marcos**", "picture": "hospital"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Departamento de Radiología**", "picture": "rayos x"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**2500 Avenida Central**, **primer piso**", "picture": "mapa"}]}, {"topic": "Antes del estudio", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Puede comer** antes del estudio.", "picture": "comer"}]}, {"topic": "Qué traer", "lines": [{"kind": "step", "text": "Su **lista** de **medicamentos**.", "picture": "lista de medicamentos"}, {"kind": "step", "text": "Sus **dentaduras**, si las usa.", "picture": "dentadura"}]}, {"topic": "¿Preguntas?", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Llame** a **Terapia del Habla**.", "picture": "teléfono"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Teléfono: (919) 555-0146", "picture": "teléfono"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": ["'No es necesario estar en ayunas' rewritten as 'Puede comer antes del estudio'. Please confirm this is the same meaning for patients."]}}
{"id": "appointment-telehealth-en-001", "language": "en", "doc_type": "appointment", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Telehealth visit instructions (made-up example)", "original": "Your Telehealth Speech Therapy Visit. Your video visit with Alex Romero, M.A., CCC-SLP, is scheduled for Thursday, March 4, 2027 at 11:00 a.m. 15 minutes before your visit, open the email from Piedmont Speech Clinic and click the link to join. You can also join at www.example.org/visit. You will need a computer, tablet, or smartphone with a camera and microphone. Find a quiet, well-lit room. Have your glasses and hearing aids ready, if you use them. If you have technical problems, call (919) 555-0193.", "target": {"title": "Your video visit", "language": "en", "source": "Telehealth visit instructions (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "Your video visit", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "You have a **video visit**.", "picture": "video call"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "This is **speech therapy**.", "picture": "speech therapist"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "With **Alex Romero, M.A., CCC-SLP**.", "picture": "speech therapist"}]}, {"topic": "When", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Thursday, March 4, 2027**", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**11:00 a.m.**", "picture": "clock"}]}, {"topic": "What you need", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "A **computer**, **tablet** or **smartphone**.", "picture": "computer"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It needs a **camera** and a **microphone**.", "picture": "camera"}]}, {"topic": "Get ready", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Find a **quiet** room.", "picture": "quiet"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Find a room with good **light**.", "picture": "lamp"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Have your **glasses** and **hearing aids**, if you use them.", "picture": "glasses"}]}, {"topic": "Join the visit", "lines": [{"kind": "step", "text": "Wait until **15 minutes** before your visit.", "picture": "clock"}, {"kind": "step", "text": "Open the **email** from **Piedmont Speech Clinic**.", "picture": "email"}, {"kind": "step", "text": "**Click** the **link**.", "picture": "click"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Or go to: **www.example.org/visit**", "picture": "website"}]}, {"topic": "Need help?", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Computer problems**? **Call**.", "picture": "help"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Help: (919) 555-0193", "picture": "phone"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": []}}
{"id": "appointment-lab-es-001", "language": "es", "doc_type": "appointment", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Recordatorio de cita de laboratorio (ejemplo inventado)", "original": "Recordatorio de cita para análisis de sangre. Tiene una cita en el Laboratorio de la Clínica Familiar Las Palmas el lunes 15 de marzo de 2027 a las 7:45 a.m. Este análisis requiere ayuno. No coma ni beba nada excepto agua durante 8 horas antes de su cita. Puede tomar sus medicamentos habituales con agua, a menos que su médico le indique lo contrario. Traiga una identificación con foto y su tarjeta de seguro. Si necesita cambiar la cita, llame al (919) 555-0172.", "target": {"title": "Análisis de sangre", "language": "es", "source": "Recordatorio de cita de laboratorio (ejemplo inventado)", "pages": [{"topic": "Análisis de sangre", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Usted tiene una **cita**.", "picture": "cita médica"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Le van a sacar **sangre**.", "picture": "análisis de sangre"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "En el **Laboratorio** de la **Clínica Familiar Las Palmas**.", "picture": "laboratorio"}]}, {"topic": "Cuándo", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**lunes 15 de marzo de 2027**", "picture": "calendario"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**7:45 a.m.**", "picture": "reloj"}]}, {"topic": "No coma antes", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**No coma** nada por **8 horas** antes.", "picture": "no comer"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**No beba** nada, solo **agua**.", "picture": "agua"}]}, {"topic": "Sus medicamentos", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Puede tomar sus **medicamentos** con **agua**.", "picture": "pastilla y agua"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A menos que su **médico** le diga **otra cosa**.", "picture": "médico"}]}, {"topic": "Qué traer", "lines": [{"kind": "step", "text": "Su **identificación** con **foto**.", "picture": "identificación"}, {"kind": "step", "text": "Su **tarjeta de seguro**.", "picture": "tarjeta de seguro"}]}, {"topic": "Cambiar la cita", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "¿Necesita **cambiar** la cita?", "picture": "calendario"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Teléfono: (919) 555-0172", "picture": "teléfono"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": []}}
{"id": "discharge-tia-en-001", "language": "en", "doc_type": "discharge", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Discharge instructions after TIA (made-up example)", "original": "Discharge Summary: Patient Instructions. Diagnosis: Transient ischemic attack (TIA). A TIA is a temporary blockage of blood flow to the brain. It is a warning sign that you are at higher risk for a stroke. Medication: aspirin 81 mg by mouth once daily. Check your blood pressure at home every morning and write it down. Bring your log to your follow-up with Dr. Samuel Ortiz on Wednesday, January 20, 2027 at 3:00 p.m. Call 911 right away if you have any of these signs: face drooping, arm weakness, speech difficulty. Remember BE FAST: Balance, Eyes, Face, Arm, Speech, Time to call 911. Questions: call the Stroke Clinic at (919) 555-0109.", "target": {"title": "Going home after your TIA", "language": "en", "source": "Discharge instructions after TIA (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "You had a TIA", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "You had a **TIA**.", "picture": "brain"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Blood** to your **brain** was **blocked** for a short time.", "picture": "brain"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It is a **warning sign**.", "picture": "warning"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "You are at **higher risk** for a **stroke**.", "picture": "stroke"}]}, {"topic": "Your medicine", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Take **aspirin 81 mg**.", "picture": "pill"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Take it **once** every **day**.", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Swallow it **by mouth**.", "picture": "mouth"}]}, {"topic": "Check your blood pressure", "lines": [{"kind": "step", "text": "Check your **blood pressure** every **morning**.", "picture": "blood pressure"}, {"kind": "step", "text": "**Write it down**.", "picture": "write"}, {"kind": "step", "text": "**Bring** the list to your **doctor**.", "picture": "list"}]}, {"topic": "See your doctor", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "See **Dr. Samuel Ortiz**.", "picture": "doctor"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Wednesday, January 20, 2027**", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**3:00 p.m.**", "picture": "clock"}]}, {"topic": "Stroke warning signs", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Face **drooping**?", "picture": "face"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Arm **weak**?", "picture": "weak arm"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Trouble **speaking**?", "picture": "speech"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Call 911 right away", "picture": "ambulance"}]}, {"topic": "Remember BE FAST", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**B**alance, **E**yes, **F**ace", "picture": "balance"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**A**rm, **S**peech", "picture": "arm"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Time to call 911", "picture": "ambulance"}]}, {"topic": "Questions?", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Questions**? Call the **Stroke Clinic**.", "picture": "question"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Stroke Clinic: (919) 555-0109", "picture": "phone"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": ["'Temporary blockage of blood flow' rewritten as 'blood to your brain was blocked for a short time'.", "BE FAST letters are split over 2 lines plus the 911 line. Please check this is clear."]}}
{"id": "discharge-stroke-es-001", "language": "es", "doc_type": "discharge", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Instrucciones al salir del hospital (ejemplo inventado)", "original": "Instrucciones al salir del hospital. Usted fue tratado por un accidente cerebrovascular (derrame cerebral). Medicamentos nuevos: atorvastatina 40 mg, una tableta cada noche; clopidogrel 75 mg, una tableta cada mañana. No deje de tomar sus medicamentos sin hablar con su médico. Actividad: puede caminar dentro de la casa. No maneje hasta que su médico lo autorice. Cita de seguimiento: Dra. Lucía Herrera, Neurología, viernes 22 de enero de 2027 a las 10:00 a.m. Si tiene debilidad repentina, dificultad para hablar o la cara caída, llame al 911 de inmediato.", "target": {"title": "Al salir del hospital", "language": "es", "source": "Instrucciones al salir del hospital (ejemplo inventado)", "pages": [{"topic": "Usted tuvo un derrame", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Usted tuvo un **derrame cerebral**.", "picture": "cerebro"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "El hospital lo **trató**.", "picture": "hospital"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Ahora va a **casa**.", "picture": "casa"}]}, {"topic": "Medicina de la noche", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Atorvastatina 40 mg**", "picture": "pastilla"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Tome **una tableta**.", "picture": "pastilla"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cada **noche**.", "picture": "noche"}]}, {"topic": "Medicina de la mañana", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Clopidogrel 75 mg**", "picture": "pastilla"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Tome **una tableta**.", "picture": "pastilla"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Cada **mañana**.", "picture": "mañana"}]}, {"topic": "No pare sus medicinas", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**No deje** de tomar sus medicinas.", "picture": "no parar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Primero **hable** con su **médico**.", "picture": "médico"}]}, {"topic": "Actividad", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Puede **caminar** dentro de la **casa**.", "picture": "caminar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**No maneje**.", "picture": "no manejar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Espere a que su **médico** diga que **sí**.", "picture": "médico"}]}, {"topic": "Su cita", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Con la **Dra. Lucía Herrera**.", "picture": "doctora"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Es en **Neurología**.", "picture": "cerebro"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**viernes 22 de enero de 2027**", "picture": "calendario"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**10:00 a.m.**", "picture": "reloj"}]}, {"topic": "Emergencia", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "¿**Debilidad** de repente?", "picture": "brazo débil"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "¿Le cuesta **hablar**?", "picture": "hablar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "¿La **cara** caída?", "picture": "cara"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Llame al 911 de inmediato", "picture": "ambulancia"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": ["'Accidente cerebrovascular' shortened to 'derrame cerebral', the term the original also gives."]}}
{"id": "medication-warfarin-en-001", "language": "en", "doc_type": "medication", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Warfarin instructions (made-up example)", "original": "Medication Instructions: Warfarin (Coumadin). Your dose: warfarin 5 mg by mouth once daily at 5:00 p.m. Warfarin thins your blood to help prevent clots. You will need regular blood tests (INR) to check your dose. Your next INR check is on Monday, February 1, 2027 at Cedar Grove Anticoagulation Clinic. Keep the amount of green leafy vegetables you eat about the same each week. Do not take aspirin or ibuprofen unless your doctor says it is okay. Call the clinic at (919) 555-0138 if you notice unusual bruising, bleeding gums, or blood in your urine or stool. Call 911 for a bad fall, a hit to the head, or bleeding that will not stop.", "target": {"title": "Your medicine: warfarin", "language": "en", "source": "Warfarin instructions (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "Your medicine: warfarin", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Your medicine is **warfarin** (**Coumadin**).", "picture": "pill"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It **thins** your **blood**.", "picture": "blood"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It helps stop **blood clots**.", "picture": "blood clot"}]}, {"topic": "How to take it", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Take **warfarin 5 mg**.", "picture": "pill"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Take it **once** a **day**.", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Take it at **5:00 p.m.**", "picture": "clock"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Swallow it **by mouth**.", "picture": "mouth"}]}, {"topic": "Blood tests", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "You need **blood tests**.", "picture": "blood test"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "The test is called **INR**.", "picture": "blood test"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It checks your **dose**.", "picture": "check"}]}, {"topic": "Your next blood test", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Monday, February 1, 2027**", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "At **Cedar Grove Anticoagulation Clinic**.", "picture": "clinic"}]}, {"topic": "Food", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Eat about the **same amount** of green leafy vegetables.", "picture": "lettuce"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Keep it the same **each week**.", "picture": "calendar"}]}, {"topic": "Other medicines", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**No aspirin**.", "picture": "no pill"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**No ibuprofen**.", "picture": "no pill"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Only if your **doctor** says it is **okay**.", "picture": "doctor"}]}, {"topic": "Call the clinic", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Strange **bruises**?", "picture": "bruise"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Bleeding** gums?", "picture": "teeth"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Blood** in your **urine** or **stool**?", "picture": "toilet"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Clinic: (919) 555-0138", "picture": "phone"}]}, {"topic": "Emergency", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "A **bad fall**?", "picture": "fall"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "You **hit** your **head**?", "picture": "head"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Bleeding** that will **not stop**?", "picture": "blood"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Call 911", "picture": "ambulance"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": []}}
{"id": "medication-lisinopril-es-001", "language": "es", "doc_type": "medication", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Instrucciones de lisinopril (ejemplo inventado)", "original": "Instrucciones de medicamento: Lisinopril 10 mg. Tome 1 tableta por la boca una vez al día, por la mañana. Este medicamento baja la presión arterial. Levántese despacio si está sentado o acostado, porque puede sentirse mareado. Si tiene tos seca que no se quita, llame a su farmacia: Farmacia Central, (919) 555-0154. Si tiene hinchazón en la cara, los labios o la lengua, o dificultad para respirar, llame al 911.", "target": {"title": "Su medicina: lisinopril", "language": "es", "source": "Instrucciones de lisinopril (ejemplo inventado)", "pages": [{"topic": "Su medicina", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Su medicina es **lisinopril 10 mg**.", "picture": "pastilla"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Baja la **presión arterial**.", "picture": "presión arterial"}]}, {"topic": "Cómo tomarla", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Tome **1 tableta**.", "picture": "pastilla"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Por la **boca**.", "picture": "boca"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Una vez** al día, por la **mañana**.", "picture": "mañana"}]}, {"topic": "Levántese despacio", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Puede sentirse **mareado**.", "picture": "mareo"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Si está sentado o acostado, levántese **despacio**.", "picture": "levantarse"}]}, {"topic": "Tos seca", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "¿Tiene **tos seca** que no se quita?", "picture": "tos"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Llame a la **Farmacia Central**.", "picture": "farmacia"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Farmacia: (919) 555-0154", "picture": "teléfono"}]}, {"topic": "Emergencia", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "¿**Hinchazón** en la cara, los labios o la lengua?", "picture": "cara hinchada"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "¿Le cuesta **respirar**?", "picture": "respirar"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Llame al 911", "picture": "ambulancia"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": []}}
{"id": "mental-health-es-001", "language": "es", "doc_type": "mental_health", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Apoyo emocional después de un derrame (ejemplo inventado)", "original": "Apoyo emocional después de un derrame cerebral. Es común sentir tristeza, ansiedad o enojo después de un derrame cerebral. Estos sentimientos pueden afectar su recuperación. Hable con su médico o terapeuta si se siente triste la mayor parte del día durante más de dos semanas. El Grupo de Apoyo Juntos se reúne en español el segundo martes de cada mes a las 6:30 p.m. en la Iglesia San José, salón 4. Para información, llame a María Torres al (919) 555-0168. Si tiene pensamientos de hacerse daño, llame o envíe un mensaje de texto al 988 (Línea 988 de Prevención del Suicidio y Crisis). Está disponible las 24 horas.", "target": {"title": "Sus sentimientos después de un derrame", "language": "es", "source": "Apoyo emocional después de un derrame (ejemplo inventado)", "pages": [{"topic": "Sus sentimientos", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Muchas personas se sienten **tristes**.", "picture": "triste"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "O sienten **ansiedad** o **enojo**.", "picture": "enojado"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Es **común** después de un **derrame cerebral**.", "picture": "cerebro"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Esto puede afectar su **recuperación**.", "picture": "recuperación"}]}, {"topic": "Hable con alguien", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "¿Triste casi **todo el día**?", "picture": "triste"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "¿Por **más de dos semanas**?", "picture": "calendario"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Hable** con su **médico** o **terapeuta**.", "picture": "médico"}]}, {"topic": "Un grupo puede ayudar", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Grupo de Apoyo Juntos**", "picture": "grupo"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Es en **español**.", "picture": "hablar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "El **segundo martes** de cada mes.", "picture": "calendario"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A las **6:30 p.m.**", "picture": "reloj"}]}, {"topic": "Dónde", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Iglesia San José**, **salón 4**.", "picture": "iglesia"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "María Torres: (919) 555-0168", "picture": "teléfono"}]}, {"topic": "Ayuda ahora", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "¿Piensa en **hacerse daño**?", "picture": "ayuda"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Llame o envíe un mensaje de texto al 988 (Línea 988 de Prevención del Suicidio y Crisis)", "picture": "teléfono"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Está disponible las **24 horas**.", "picture": "reloj"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": ["Crisis line kept word for word."]}}
{"id": "mental-health-connection-en-002", "language": "en", "doc_type": "mental_health", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Social connection and aphasia (made-up example)", "original": "Social Connection and Aphasia. People with aphasia are at increased risk of social isolation and depression. Staying socially engaged supports emotional well-being and language recovery. Consider joining an aphasia-friendly community program. The Aphasia Café meets every Saturday at 10:00 a.m. at Brightleaf Coffee, 305 Main Street. Trained volunteers support conversation. For more information, contact Priya Shah at (919) 555-0127 or pshah@example.org. If you feel hopeless or have thoughts of suicide, call or text 988 to reach the 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline.", "target": {"title": "Stay connected", "language": "en", "source": "Social connection and aphasia (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "Stay connected", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Aphasia can make you feel **alone**.", "picture": "alone"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Some people feel **depressed**.", "picture": "sad"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Talking** with others **helps**.", "picture": "conversation"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It helps your **mood** and your **language**.", "picture": "happy"}]}, {"topic": "Aphasia Café", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Join the **Aphasia Café**.", "picture": "coffee"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Volunteers** help you **talk**.", "picture": "volunteer"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Every **Saturday** at **10:00 a.m.**", "picture": "calendar"}]}, {"topic": "Where", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Brightleaf Coffee**", "picture": "cafe"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**305 Main Street**", "picture": "map"}]}, {"topic": "More information", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Contact **Priya Shah**.", "picture": "person"}, {"kind": "phone", "text": "Phone: (919) 555-0127", "picture": "phone"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Email: **pshah@example.org**", "picture": "email"}]}, {"topic": "Help now", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Feel **hopeless**?", "picture": "sad"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Thinking about **suicide**?", "picture": "help"}, {"kind": "crisis", "text": "Call or text 988 — 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline", "picture": "phone"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": []}}
{"id": "results-language-en-001", "language": "en", "doc_type": "results", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "Speech-language evaluation summary form (made-up example)", "original": "Speech-Language Evaluation: Summary of Results for ____________. Diagnosis: [ ] Expressive aphasia [ ] Receptive aphasia [ ] Global aphasia [ ] Apraxia of speech [ ] Dysarthria. Areas of difficulty: [ ] Word retrieval [ ] Auditory comprehension [ ] Reading comprehension [ ] Written expression [ ] Speech intelligibility. Recommendation: speech-language therapy ___ times per week for ___ weeks. Treatment goals: [ ] Improve word retrieval in conversation [ ] Improve comprehension of multi-step directions [ ] Improve functional reading (e.g., medication labels) [ ] Use a communication book or device. Your therapist: ____________ Phone: ____________", "target": {"title": "Your speech and language results", "language": "en", "source": "Speech-language evaluation summary form (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "Your results", "lines": [{"kind": "blank", "text": "Results for: ____________", "picture": "person"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "You had a **speech** and **language** test.", "picture": "speech therapist"}]}, {"topic": "What you have", "lines": [{"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Hard to **say** what you want (**expressive aphasia**).", "picture": "talk"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Hard to **understand** words (**receptive aphasia**).", "picture": "listen"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Hard to **talk** and **understand** (**global aphasia**).", "picture": "talk and listen"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Hard to **move** your mouth to speak (**apraxia of speech**).", "picture": "mouth"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Speech muscles are **weak**, speech is **unclear** (**dysarthria**).", "picture": "mouth"}]}, {"topic": "What is hard for you", "lines": [{"kind": "checkbox", "text": "**Finding** words.", "picture": "search"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "**Understanding** what people say.", "picture": "listen"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "**Reading**.", "picture": "read"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "**Writing**.", "picture": "write"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Others **understanding** your speech.", "picture": "conversation"}]}, {"topic": "Your therapy", "lines": [{"kind": "blank", "text": "Speech therapy ___ times a week.", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "blank", "text": "For ___ weeks.", "picture": "calendar"}]}, {"topic": "Your goals", "lines": [{"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Find **words** when you **talk**.", "picture": "talk"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Follow **directions** with **steps**.", "picture": "steps"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "**Read** things like **medicine labels**.", "picture": "medicine label"}, {"kind": "checkbox", "text": "Use a **communication book** or **device**.", "picture": "communication book"}]}, {"topic": "Your therapist", "lines": [{"kind": "blank", "text": "Therapist: ____________", "picture": "speech therapist"}, {"kind": "blank", "text": "Phone: ____________", "picture": "phone"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": ["Diagnosis names are kept in brackets after a plain explanation. Please check the plain explanations are accurate."]}}
{"id": "procedure-mri-en-001", "language": "en", "doc_type": "procedure", "split": "train", "provenance": "made-up (written for this project)", "license": "CC BY 4.0 (project-authored)", "slp_reviewed": false, "source": "MRI preparation instructions (made-up example)", "original": "Preparing for Your MRI. Your MRI of the brain is scheduled for Tuesday, February 16, 2027 at 1:30 p.m. at Northgate Imaging Center, 4410 Pinecrest Parkway. Arrive 30 minutes early. You may eat and take your medications as usual. Remove all metal objects, including jewelry, hearing aids, and hairpins. Tell the technologist if you have a pacemaker, metal implants, or a medication pump. The scan takes about 45 minutes. You will need to lie still. The machine makes loud knocking sounds; earplugs will be provided. Questions: (919) 555-0181.", "target": {"title": "Your brain MRI", "language": "en", "source": "MRI preparation instructions (made-up example)", "pages": [{"topic": "Your brain MRI", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "You will have an **MRI**.", "picture": "mri"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It takes **pictures** of your **brain**.", "picture": "brain"}]}, {"topic": "When and where", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "**Tuesday, February 16, 2027**", "picture": "calendar"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**1:30 p.m.**", "picture": "clock"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Northgate Imaging Center**", "picture": "hospital"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**4410 Pinecrest Parkway**", "picture": "map"}]}, {"topic": "Before you come", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Come **30 minutes early**.", "picture": "clock"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "You can **eat** as usual.", "picture": "eat"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Take your **medicines** as usual.", "picture": "pill"}]}, {"topic": "No metal", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Take off all **metal**.", "picture": "no metal"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Jewelry**, **hearing aids**, **hairpins**.", "picture": "jewelry"}]}, {"topic": "Tell the staff", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "Do you have a **pacemaker**?", "picture": "heart"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Metal implants**?", "picture": "implant"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "A **medicine pump**?", "picture": "pump"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Tell** the **technologist**.", "picture": "nurse"}]}, {"topic": "During the MRI", "lines": [{"kind": "text", "text": "It takes about **45 minutes**.", "picture": "clock"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "**Lie still**.", "picture": "lie down"}, {"kind": "text", "text": "It is **loud**. You will get **earplugs**.", "picture": "earplugs"}]}, {"topic": "Questions?", "lines": [{"kind": "phone", "text": "Questions? Call (919) 555-0181", "picture": "phone"}]}], "notes_for_reviewer": []}}
